        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"model\": \"llama3\",\n  \"prompt\":  \"Write a professional blog article on the topic: {{$json[\\\"topic\\\"]}}.\\n\\nStructure:\\n1. Title (bold)\\n2. Introduction (2-3 lines)\\n3. 3-4 sections with headings (### format)\\n4. Conclusion\\n\\nRequirements:\\n- Use simple language\\n- Make it SEO friendly\\n- Avoid repetition\\n- Keep it around 300 words\\n- Do not include explanations outside the blog\\n\",\n  \"stream\": false\n}",
